    {
      "block_id": 12,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "Description: Adds the source operand to the destination operand along with the extend bit,\n",
      "bbox": [
        63.0,
        187.10403442382812,
        543.3547973632812,
        203.6880340576172
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.10294117647058823,
        0.2362424677068537,
        0.8878346362145119,
        0.2571818611838601
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 13,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "and stores the result in the destination location. The addition is performed using binary-\ncoded decimal arithmetic. The operands, which are packed binary-coded decimal\nnumbers, can be addressed in two different ways: \n",
      "bbox": [
        89.2509994506836,
        201.10806274414062,
        543.4387817382812,
        245.60411071777344
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.14583496642268562,
        0.2539243216466422,
        0.8879718655854268,
        0.3101062004012291
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 14,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "1. Data Register to Data Register: The operands are contained in the data regis-\nters specified in the instruction. \n",
      "bbox": [
        107.9949951171875,
        243.12014770507812,
        538.8548583984375,
        273.6121826171875
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.1764624103222018,
        0.30696988346600773,
        0.8804817947686887,
        0.34546992754695394
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 15,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "2. Memory to Memory: The operands are addressed with the predecrement ad-\ndressing mode using the address registers specified in the instruction. \n",
      "bbox": [
        107.9949951171875,
        276.12017822265625,
        532.8189086914062,
        306.6121826171875
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.1764624103222018,
        0.34863658866497,
        0.870619131848703,
        0.38713659421362057
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 16,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "This operation is a byte operation only. \n",
      "bbox": [
        89.9949951171875,
        316.128173828125,
        299.4309387207031,
        332.6161804199219
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
